{"id":"n236844d916fb","url":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/fdi-remembers-dr-guillermo-rivero-and-his-contribution-oral-health","title":"FDI remembers Dr Guillermo Rivero and his contribution to oral health","source":"FDI World Dental Federation","date":"2026-08-10T12:00:00.000Z","byline":"","image":"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=ZlTxIt1j","imageKind":"","imageBg":"","html":"<p>FDI remembers Dr Guillermo Rivero, a dedicated oral health advocate and leader whose work made a lasting contribution to oral health in Argentina and beyond.</p> <figure> Image <picture> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plan_1x_xl/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=2b-hZzzW 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xl/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=-7Aib_IO 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_lg/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=KKewsCa5 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_lg/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=yqe93iXf 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_md/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=EFG-5LMZ 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_md/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=T-z8X50t 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_sm/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=MJvWNkRB 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_sm/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=ZKoVhqD2 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=ZlTxIt1j 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=gw2UOj4S 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <img src=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_WDC_18-Buenos_Aires-20180905-329.jpg?itok=ZlTxIt1j\" alt=\"Dr Guillermo Rivero\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </figure> <p>FDI World Dental Federation (FDI) is deeply saddened by the passing of Dr Guillermo Rivero. Throughout his career, Dr Rivero promoted oral health locally, regionally, and globally, and stood out as a passionate oral health advocate whose dedication contributed to a world with optimal oral health.</p>\n<p>Apart from his recent appointment to Presidency of the FDI Latin American Regional Organization (LARO), FDI appreciated working with Dr Rivero in his capacity of Secretary General of the Confederación Odontológicade la República Argentina (CORA), our valued member.</p>\n<p>He helped strengthen the oral health community in Argentina through committed leadership and collaboration. He was a regular representative of CORA at the FDI General Assemblies and a very dear friend to many across the FDI community.</p>\n<p>Dr Rivero’s impact extended beyond Latin America. He was instrumental in co-organizing the FDI World Dental Congress in Buenos Aires, Argentina in 2018, which welcomed nearly 8,000 participants from around the globe. He was helping bring together colleagues and experts from around the world to support scientific exchange and further promote oral health.</p>\n<p>FDI honours his legacy and is grateful for the lasting contribution he made to oral health.</p>\n<p>On behalf of everyone at FDI, we extend our heartfelt condolences to Dr Rivero’s family, friends and colleagues.&nbsp;</p><figure> Image <picture> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plan_1x_xl/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=WIFTvx9z 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xl/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=6xq6chL3 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_lg/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=gBdAbYSc 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_lg/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=iRqIPYzS 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_md/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=1rzCfJmy 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_md/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=JDGm9GLO 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_sm/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=g1UxSpl8 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_sm/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=uXhTUyXE 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <source srcset=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=PgkvPHaK 1x, https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_2x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=qlCmLItU 2x\" type=\"image/jpeg\"> <img src=\"https://www.fdiworlddental.org/sites/default/files/styles/ino_plain_1x_xs/public/2026-10/FDI_BM_18-Buenos_Aires-20180902-007.jpg?itok=PgkvPHaK\" alt=\"Dr Guillermo Rivero\" loading=\"lazy\"> </picture> </figure>","kind":"full"}